      "instance_name": "man",
      "label": "a man with a beard and crossed arms",
      "description": "The central figure in the image is a middle-aged man with a long, grayish beard and mustache. He has a stern, serious facial expression, looking directly at the camera. His arms are crossed over his chest, suggesting a defensive or confrontational posture. He is wearing a light-colored, possibly beige or gray, button-up shirt with the sleeves rolled up. A watch is visible on his left wrist. The man’s appearance and demeanor are central to the meme’s visual material and are used to represent a caricatured 'Muslim immigrant' as described in the text overlay.",
