      "description": "A common Islamophobic stereotype that falsely portrays Sharia law as inherently incompatible with Western values and as a threat to secular governance, often used to stigmatize Muslims and justify discrimination. This concept is central to the meme's text, which falsely claims that Muslims intend to impose Sharia law on America.",
