      "instance_name": "islamophobia",
      "label": "Islamophobia",
      "description": "A systemic prejudice and fear of Islam and Muslims, often manifesting as stereotypes that portray Muslims as inherently violent, oppressive, or incompatible with Western societies. The meme relies on this broader social phenomenon to frame its caricature of a Muslim immigrant as a threat.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
