      "instance_name": "muslim_immigration_stereotype",
      "label": "Muslim Immigration Stereotype",
      "description": "A derogatory stereotype that falsely claims Muslims immigrate to Western countries primarily to impose their religious laws, often used to justify xenophobia and discriminatory policies. The bottom text of the meme explicitly references this stereotype as 'the real reason for most Muslim immigration', which is a false and inflammatory claim.",
