      "instance_name": "sharia_law",
      "label": "Sharia Law",
      "description": "A comprehensive legal and ethical system derived from Islamic jurisprudence, which governs various aspects of life including personal conduct, family law, and criminal justice. The meme misrepresents Sharia law as a tool for oppression and a threat to American values, which is a common but inaccurate trope.",
